  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added WorldDataModel, WorldLotArchitectureModel and WorldObjectDataModel for the WorldData, WorldLotArchitecture and WorldObjectData resources of world files; each round-trips byte for byte every such resource the installed game ships.\nAdded the RecordBundle format (in LlamaLogic.Packages.Formats), the LDNB record bundle in which the game stores lot architecture in world files, save games and tray blueprints.\nAdded WorldLotArchitectureModel.GetKey and WorldLotArchitectureModel.GetLotTemplateInstance, which give the keys the game derives from a lot template id, and WorldDataModel.GetKey, which gives the key the game derives from a world file name.\nAdded DataBasePackedFile.GetWorldData, GetWorldLotArchitecture and GetWorldObjectData, along with their asynchronous counterparts, and Model.Decode and Model.GetModelType now support the three new resource types.",
